        {
          "text": "Lino Davida wakaita boonse bami ba-Israyeli, bami bamisyobo abami bankamu zyabasimilimo bamwami abami bazyuulu abami bamyanda abami bambono abaŋombe zyamwami abana bakwe abasiŋanda abasilumamba abaalumi basintaze boonse, wababunganya ku-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
