        {
          "text": "Nkabela mwami Davida naakanyampuka, wakabaambila kuti, Amundiswiilile nubakwesu abantu bangu, Mumoyo wangu ndakali kuyanda kuyaka iŋanda yakulyokezezya yabbokesi lyacizuminano ca-Jehova acuuno camaulu aa-Leza wesu, aboobo ndakatalika kulibamba kuyaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
