                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakandaambila kuti, Mwanaako Solomoni nguuelede kuyaka iŋanda yangu alubanza lwayo, nkaambo ngonguwe ngundasala kuti abe mwanaangu, ambebo njooba wisi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
