                  "text": "Dt 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako ndamucenjezya, kumeso aaba-Israyeli boonse, imbungano ya-Jehova amumatwi aa-Leza wesu, kuti mubike myoyo yanu kukubamba milazyo yoonse yaJehova Leza wesu, kuti muvube nyika eyi imbotu, akwiisia mumaanza aabana banu baciza, ibe lukono lwabo mazuba oonse mane kukabe kutamani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
