        },
        {
          "text": "Ayebo Solomoni mwanaangu, koziba Leza wauso, akumumanina milimo camoyo woonse acamiyeeyo iizuminisya, nkaambo Jehova ulalingula myoyo yoonse, ulazibisya makanze oonse amiyeeyo yoonse, Na ulamuyandaula, ulamujana, pele na wamuleka, ulakusowelela, ",
          "type": "text",
