        {
          "text": "Mpawo Davida wakapa Solomoni mwanaakwe cifwanikisyo calukonkono lwakunembo lyantempele acamaanda aayo acaziyobwedo zyayo azyatwaanda twayo twakujulu acatwaanda twayo twamukati acaŋanda yacuuno caluzyalo, ",
