          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abulemu bwaziimikilo zyamalampi zyangolida abwamalampi aazyo, bulemu bwangolida bwaciimikilo cimwi acimwi abwalampi lyaco, abulemu bwansiliva bwaciimikilo cimwi acimwi abwalampi lyaco, mbubonya mbuli ziimikilo mbuzyakabede, ",
