        {
          "text": "Mpawo Davida wakaambila Solomoni mwanaakwe kuti, Koliyumya akuba abukozu, ukaicite, Utayoowi nikuba kukankama, nkaambo Leza Jehova, Leza wangu, uli ayebo, Takooyookuleka nanka kukusia, mane milimo yoonse yakubelekela iŋanda ya-Jehova imane. ",
